      "heading": "",
      "original": "壬申日庚子时壬寅时甲辰时乙巳时辛亥时",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "10-abac1a0c84c1d3db7d7c-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "壬戌日壬寅时庚戌时辛亥时",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "10-c9009002fe9ae8b635cb-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "六壬日见壬寅时，名曰太虚，贵不久盛而祸生。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "10-da977fa70a1c775209e1-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "癸丑日甲寅时丙寅时戊午时庚申时癸亥时",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "10-7ce102ce653450c4340b-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "癸卯日癸丑时乙卯时辛丑时癸辛时",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "10-1d89a06e834ba0a6bb04-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "癸巳日壬子时甲寅时庚申时",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "10-9703c422b4bd55b3275f-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "癸未日甲寅时丙辰时癸亥时",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "10-4e3647832353c6652a8d-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "癸酉日丙辰时庚申时癸亥时",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "10-83b4a641ec3307c9a262-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "癸亥日壬子时甲寅时戊午时庚申时癸亥时",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "10-758ffe6a71a0298bd17c-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "以上注字有神白经云者，或是引用或是附入。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "10-86777b515ad5ca480812-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "【释日时凶中贵格】",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "10-e13ec1ff1e473d2a61a4-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "甲子日己巳时癸酉时乙亥时",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "10-d38dedc8387196b6b83f-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "甲寅日壬申时＜旺中有灾>甲戌时",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "10-9c60cc272a83e7e3389f-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "甲辰日乙丑时主血贵戊辰时刑后发财庚午时出血发甲戌时有财凶",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "10-ae2ba503ddba34b158d2-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "甲午日甲子时身孤有财清贵有吉庚午时伤祖主刑发财死",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "10-5f7e583b6f1520da9bdc-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "甲申日己巳时身孤清贵壬申时离乡发福甲戌时身孤三十后财旺",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "10-75a10b732a8017986e75-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "甲戌日乙丑时先刑后财戊辰时克早身孤中年发财辛未时先刑后贵",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "10-1402be4fd646249591cc-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "乙丑日己卯时中年大福辛巳时初纯后杂",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "10-313e6e73bfc6c791924a-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "乙卯日丙子时凶中逢吉大贵庚辰时刑后大发",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "10-db8874fc509f65ea49b5-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "乙巳日戊寅时中年横发庚辰时先刑后贵甲申时刑中化贵",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "10-b8d05e116930c3bfda91-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "乙未日甲申时旺中有失终旺丙戌时旺处凶",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "10-45c4fc565d23f9fd98bb-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "乙酉日乙酉时旺处自刑己卯时先破中年旺末年死无地",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "10-13cf7b635616f9f24aef-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "乙亥日戊寅时三十年后身孤发福庚辰时发中自刑害丙戌时血疾丁亥时有财自刑",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "10-98b2305aa64c825037f5-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "丙子日壬辰时有财招是非",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "10-4a2da0634a37b03a70a7-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "丙寅日丙申时旺中脱败辛卯时无祖自立有财有肢体疾",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "10-30422f485c2ab542c64d-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "丙辰日壬辰时身孤有财丙申时横发财",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "10-2badf90c59bf3c8ecf51-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "丙午日戊子时先贫后富丙申时见血大发",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "10-3bdeaf2a2b0bc8db9327-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "丙申日己丑时见血疾后发壬辰时旺中失丙申时好色",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "10-df474b104c178d8a9e2a-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "丙戌日己丑时刑后发旺丙申时破祖了发火血灾戊戌时贫",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "10-11e45784ec3e22b821b6-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "丁丑日庚子时先贫后富辛丑时因贵人发福",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "10-738402566594aef4b43a-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "丁卯日丙子时旺中有失丁未时刑中发",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "10-0d12c16c4cf4129db939-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "丁巳日庚子时横发大富辛丑时因阴人致贵",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "10-cc12076017a9beb0b4d6-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "丁未日丙午时破祖而成大富丁未时凶中脱为大富",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "10-b07cf1a5163724cb72d9-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "丁酉日壬寅时贫中化贵丙午时不利子孙",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "10-3a073fe4dd38bd4ce5b1-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "丁亥日壬寅时五十后大旺丙午时先破后富戊申时身孤发福",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "10-d13602473870e758ba6c-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "戊子日甲寅时先破后发戊午时先刑后发",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "10-99e9574ce8fe9ea6e270-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "戊寅日甲寅时身卑贱而发丙辰时龙吟虎啸中年大贵",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "10-d5f6d694077c25fb38d0-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "戊辰日己卯时身孤而贵丙辰时克父大发",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "10-3996a2c4ad32c9019393-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "戊午日甲寅时贱中贵戊午时先刑后发",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "10-7353f29c1383647e583f-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "戊申日壬子时先带后旺庚申时刑中发",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "10-d9b42378f8069a14ad31-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "戊戌日乙卯时身卑母贱出生奴仆而发有验丙辰时破尽而后大富",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "10-a0cd45e778486ca05687-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "己丑日辛未时破尽而发甲戌时克父虽轻刑后大旺",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "10-0d0184403ff89aeb8d28-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "己卯日甲子时先破祖而后旺",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "10-1606e0edf855fa383cb1-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "己巳日丙寅时先刑后旺戊辰时身孤后发",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "10-f02862cdeeae65ed1208-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "己未日辛未时先破后成丙寅时多庶出过房或父不见生",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "10-5cdfcf9cd69eeba381fa-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "己酉日丁卯时九成十破末年旺壬申时主心狂肾病大贵",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "10-df2f98f2f5e628768396-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "己亥日辛未时凶中贵乙亥时多成破晚富",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "10-0545c171dd1d5eb9a81f-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "庚子日丙子时先无中年大贵己卯时破祖失土大贵",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "10-6837dd67fe413dec480b-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "庚寅日辛巳时孤则贵丁亥时贫中秀利末年大富旺",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "10-c302e50704ea060e0c27-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "庚辰日庚辰时大凶过则贵主恶死辛巳时先无后有",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "10-359bc9c4c6292547684c-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "庚午日壬午时破尽身孤则发乙酉时刑中贵",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "10-daae294d85f4c19ee740-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "庚申日乙卯时少贫中年有小官聪明克妻小子戊寅时先刑尾好",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "10-64a1ee3c28580980a60f-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "庚戌日丁丑时四十后大富己卯时少孤母贱中年贵",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "10-752888293c3f9b3a3be6-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "辛丑日癸巳时先父母而多福丙申时少苦中年贵",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "10-710d467bb99d224debae-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "辛卯日庚寅时发即风疾辛卯时先苦中年大发",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "10-2ea191850ac3a4f1a0bb-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "辛巳日庚寅时刑了有财丙申时少蹇中末年贵",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "10-0b76e9cf03c172aeb340-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "辛未日庚寅时风疾而发丙申时因贵人门下得富戊戌时克父母身旺中年富",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "10-e35680ec987c511511be-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "辛酉日戊子时破祖发辛卯时少贫二十后有财",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "10-1b036a941e8fac42b639-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "辛亥日庚寅时有暗疾有福丙申时多孤见血疾主财",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "10-b3922d3e02ab5187bc1b-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "壬子日庚子时少年富三十五后艰辛末年大富辛亥时父母恶疾中末大富贵",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "10-fd383de514d6a5599389-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "壬寅日壬寅时中年贵五十年大厄辛亥时艰苦中发",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "10-9949e274373538fe1ea4-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "壬辰日甲辰时少孤及贫中发辛亥时秀贵不善死",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "10-b0d5498a551b85d0d183-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "壬午日壬寅时少年疾厄中年贵辛亥时贫中大富",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "10-fe62ff578dd15f35cdd6-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "壬申日庚子时先凶后富壬寅时贫中发不久",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "10-f12643d1ad1ca2d39251-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "壬戌日庚戌时平生为妻妾所害辛亥时少年大富",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "10-649f1a74895ffc1d0cfc-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "癸丑日癸丑时孤中失土贵乙卯时少贱中年贵",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "10-dccc54277f9662471b67-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "癸卯日癸丑时克陷生孤贫丙辰时克父母有财",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "10-f276e5bcdd200f2718c3-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "癸巳日丁巳时贱中贵戊午时中年大富",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "10-948d14dc8f59108a84c7-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "癸卯日癸丑时先卑贱中年大贵甲寅时中年秀贵",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "10-ca07e13264831e8ebc6b-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "癸酉日丙辰时孤贵丁巳时先贫后富",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "10-2a5e1abadda582552f45-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "癸亥日庚申时少贫好学大才癸亥时性明飘逸中年大富",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "10-93ded276f2137aa74070-0",
      "translation": null
    }
  ],
  "editionId": "wuxing-83b291515920710865bc",
  "version": "2b66a6a4b3ae6fb30864"
}
